@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam classBackgroundColor #F8F8FF
skinparam classBorderColor #4169E1

title **KUKA iiwa14 Y-Axis Alignment Controller - Class Architecture**

class IntegratedZeroGravitySimulation {
    -model: mujoco.MjModel
    -data: mujoco.MjData
    -target_position: np.array[3]
    -controller_enabled: bool
    -gripper_target: float
    
    **ISS Orbital Parameters**
    -iss_altitude: 408000.0
    -iss_orbital_period: 5580.0
    -orbital_radius_scaled: 60.0
    -orbital_velocity_scaled: 3.0
    
    **Controller Parameters**
    -K_pos: np.diag([8.2, 10.2, 7.0])
    -K_angular_vel: np.diag([2.0, 2.0, 2.0])
    -lambda_damping: 0.25
    -max_velocity: 4.0
    
    **Data Collection**
    -current_position_data: deque
    -current_euler_data: deque
    -target_euler_data: deque
    -orientation_error_euler_data: deque
    -cumulative_current_euler: np.array[3]
    -cumulative_target_euler: np.array[3]
    
    +__init__(iiwa_model_path, door_model_path)
    +create_integrated_model()
    +setup_control_parameters()
    +run_simulation(duration)
    +position_controller()
    +get_end_effector_position()
    +compute_jacobian()
    +collect_controller_data()
    +plot_controller_data()
    +plot_error_analysis()
}

package "**Controller Components**" #LightBlue {
    class PositionController {
        +calculate_position_error()
        +calculate_orientation_error()
        +compute_desired_velocities()
        +apply_y_axis_only_control()
    }
    
    class JacobianController {
        +compute_jacobian_matrix()
        +damped_least_squares_inverse()
        +null_space_projection()
    }
    
    class OrientationTracker {
        +quaternion_to_euler()
        +unwrap_euler_angles()
        +track_continuous_angles()
        +zero_roll_yaw_errors()
    }
}

package "**Physics & Environment**" #LightGreen {
    class ISSOrbitMechanics {
        +setup_iss_orbital_parameters()
        +apply_iss_orbital_forces()
        +calculate_centripetal_force()
        +calculate_coriolis_effects()
    }
    
    class MuJoCoPhysics {
        +load_model()
        +step_simulation()
        +apply_forces()
        +handle_collisions()
    }
}

package "**Data Analysis**" #LightYellow {
    class DataCollector {
        +collect_controller_data()
        +store_continuous_euler()
        +track_performance_metrics()
    }
    
    class Visualizer {
        +plot_controller_data()
        +plot_error_analysis()
        +generate_performance_plots()
        +save_analysis_images()
    }
}

package "**Model Components**" #LightCoral {
    class KUKAModel {
        +iiwa14.xml
        +7 DOF arm joints
        +collision properties
        +joint limits
    }
    
    class RobotiqGripper {
        +2F85 gripper
        +tendon system
        +finger actuators
    }
    
    class DoorAssembly {
        +box_door_assembly
        +hinge joint
        +collision geometry
    }
}

' Relationships
IntegratedZeroGravitySimulation *-- PositionController
IntegratedZeroGravitySimulation *-- JacobianController
IntegratedZeroGravitySimulation *-- OrientationTracker
IntegratedZeroGravitySimulation *-- ISSOrbitMechanics
IntegratedZeroGravitySimulation *-- MuJoCoPhysics
IntegratedZeroGravitySimulation *-- DataCollector
IntegratedZeroGravitySimulation *-- Visualizer

IntegratedZeroGravitySimulation --> KUKAModel
IntegratedZeroGravitySimulation --> RobotiqGripper  
IntegratedZeroGravitySimulation --> DoorAssembly

note top of IntegratedZeroGravitySimulation
    **Y-AXIS ALIGNMENT CONTROLLER**
    • Only controls pitch (Y-axis) orientation
    • Ignores roll (X) and yaw (Z) axes
    • Uses continuous Euler angle tracking
    • Implements ISS orbital mechanics
    • Redundant manipulator control
end note

note bottom of OrientationTracker
    **KEY FEATURE: Y-AXIS ONLY**
    orientation_error_euler_raw[0] = 0.0  // Roll ignored
    orientation_error_euler_raw[1] = -pitch_error  // Pitch controlled
    orientation_error_euler_raw[2] = 0.0  // Yaw ignored
end note

@enduml
